  "_note": "Motorola MC6845 CRT Controller. Pin table audited against Motorola MC6845 datasheet (DS9563). DIP-40 package. Memory address bus MA0-MA13 (pins 4-17), row address RA0-RA4 (pins 39-35). CPU data bus D0-D7 (pins 33-26). Control: E (pin 31, enable), R/W (pin 32, high=read), CS (pin 30, active low), RS (pin 29, register select — 0=address, 1=data). Video timing: HSYNC (pin 40), VSYNC (pin 34), DE (pin 18, display enable), CURSOR (pin 19). CLK (pin 28), /RESET (pin 2), LPSTB (pin 3, light pen strobe). VSS=pin 1, VDD=pin 20.",
